  description: '"Dark Magician" + 1 LIGHT or DARK monster

    Must be either Fusion
    Summoned, or Special Summoned (from your Extra Deck) during the turn a Spell
    Card or effect is activated, by banishing 1 Level 6 or higher DARK Spellcaster
    monster you control as material. You can only Special Summon "Dark Magician of
    Destruction" once per turn this way, no matter which method you use. This card''s
    name becomes "Dark Magician" while on the field or in the GY. If this card is
    Special Summoned: You can add 1 "Dark Magician" or 1 card that mentions it from
    your Deck to your hand.'
